  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Given equation : 7 * 8 * 6 * 130 * 2 *3**\n\nNow by the putting the signs:-\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : +, ÷, –, =, ×\n\n​7 + **8 ÷ 6**__ - 130 = 2 × 3\n\n7 + 1.33 - 130 = __**2 **____**× 3**__\n\n**__7 + 1.33__** - 130 = 6\n\n__**8.33 - 130**__ = 6\n\n-121.76 ≠ 6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : =, ×, +, ÷, –\n\n​7 = 8 × 6 + **130 ÷ 2**__ - 3\n\n7 = __**8 **____**×**____** 6**__ + 65 - 3\n\n7 = __**48 + 65**__ - 3\n\n7 = __**113 - 3**__\n\n7 ≠ 110 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷, ×, =, +, –\n\n​**7 ÷ 8**__ × 6 = 130 + 2 - 3\n\n__**0.875 ×**____** 6**__ = 130 + 2 - 3\n\n5.25 = __**130 + 2**__ - 3\n\n5.25 = __**132 - 3**__\n\n5.25 ≠ 129 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ×, +, =, ÷, –\n\n​7 × 8 + 6 = **130 ÷ 2**__ - 3\n\n__**7 ×**____** 8**__ + 6 = 65 - 3\n\n__**56 + 6**__ = 62\n\n62 = 62 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (4)\"** is the correct answer.\n\nb4:T18",
